Dialogue: 0,00:02:18.14,00:02:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to send it over\Nto the cargo shed.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:20.89,00:02:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on its way.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:35.78,00:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:37.61,00:02:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ferrier. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:39.95,00:02:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you back in four instead of 12.\NI got half of Korea coming in at noon.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:43.50,00:02:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, I can't.\NI'm on a 12-hour blow. Call Tedesco.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:47.12,00:02:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Tedesco can't move\N40 containers in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:50.25,00:02:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta have somebody\Nwho can do double picks.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:52.63,00:02:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could help you, Sal.\NIt's the goddamn union regulations.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:56.22,00:02:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.\NI'm in a position here, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:58.59,00:03:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember\Nthe union regulations, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:02.10,00:03:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what your problem is?
Dialogue: 0,00:03:04.27,00:03:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can think of a couple women\Nwho'd be happy to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:42.97,00:03:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Three and two...</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:04:13.75,00:04:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Steven, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:15.42,00:04:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's up?\N- Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,00:04:21.39,00:04:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever see something like that?
Dialogue: 0,00:04:24.18,00:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Springtime, maybe.\NNot this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:26.85,00:04:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can see better\Nfrom the back yard.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:51.67,00:04:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta come see this!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:04.97,00:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- That is so weird.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,00:05:08.43,00:05:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing\Ntoward the storm.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:10.77,00:05:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:13.10,00:05:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,00:05:16.73,00:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel,\Nyou wanna see something cool?
Dialogue: 0,00:05:52.93,00:05:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:54.81,00:05:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- I wanna go inside.\N- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:57.11,00:05:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna go inside.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:59.61,00:06:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:03.28,00:06:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough weather for me.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:06.24,00:06:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:12.08,00:06:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:14.75,00:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Come on, like the Fourth of July.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:18.04,00:06:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- No, it's not.\N- O, say can...</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:34.64,00:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Robbie?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:37.85,00:06:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:40.73,00:06:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Robbie okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:44.86,00:06:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:46.86,00:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the thunder?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:49.28,00:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't it stop?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:05.22,00:07:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:21.31,00:07:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:23.69,00:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... I'm just checking things out.\NJust wait... Wait there.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:27.78,00:07:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are we gonna be okay?\N- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:30.62,00:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- You don't know?\N- No, I meant, I just... Just...
Dialogue: 0,00:07:32.83,00:07:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel, please.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:34.66,00:07:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop asking so many questions.\NJust wait here.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:15.91,00:08:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn everything off.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:18.29,00:08:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is off.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:20.50,00:08:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get one freaking thing\Nto turn on.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:25.71,00:08:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe this, Ray?\NEvery single car.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:30.47,00:08:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus. Jesus, Jesus, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:32.55,00:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- The car just stopped, and...\N- You're okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:34.64,00:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? You all right?\N- The lightning started to hit.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:37.56,00:08:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- And me and this other guy...\N- Where the hell did you go?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:39.81,00:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Over on Lincoln Avenue.\N- Lincoln Avenue?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:42.52,00:08:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- By the church.\N- You saw the lightning?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:44.11,00:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 26 times we counted,\Nover and over again.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:46.48,00:08:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The lightning started to hit.\NIt opened up this hole or something...
Dialogue: 0,00:08:49.49,00:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Twenty-six times?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:52.45,00:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're okay?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:53.95,00:08:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. All right, well,\Nyour sister is in the house,
Dialogue: 0,00:08:56.24,00:08:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want you to go in that house\Nand I want you to stay with her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:59.70,00:09:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time you take my car with\Nno driver's license and no permission,
Dialogue: 0,00:09:03.71,00:09:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:07.34,00:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be there when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:10.34,00:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:17.31,00:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Manny, Manny.\NManny, what is it, dead?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:20.64,00:09:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them. Everything.\NLook at this.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:23.52,00:09:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- The starter's fried.\N- Lightning hit it?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:25.77,00:09:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close.\NI thought if I changed it...
Dialogue: 0,00:09:28.28,00:09:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Any idea what's going on?\N- I'm on my way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:30.82,00:09:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Try changing the solenoid.\NIt's probably fried.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:33.07,00:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that's what I said.\NI told you that. The solenoid.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:36.20,00:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're saying all the\Nlightning struck down by the church.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:51.17,00:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on\Naround here?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:55.43,00:09:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let us through.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:56.80,00:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let us through here.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:05.60,00:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:07.36,00:10:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That many strikes of lightning\Nin one spot?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:09.77,00:10:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this the only place?\N- Come on, put that down.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:11.82,00:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- You wanna step back, please?\N- Step back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:14.11,00:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna fall in.\N- Get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:18.45,00:10:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up, people.\NPeople, back up back there.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:22.83,00:10:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back. Everybody back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:25.96,00:10:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:28.00,00:10:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Move back.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:33.26,00:10:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is it hot?\N- Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:34.76,00:10:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:36.68,00:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's freezing.\N- What is that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:39.01,00:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. Move. You feel that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:40.76,00:10:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- I feel that.\N- Hey, Bobby, come check this out.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:44.48,00:10:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- You feel that?\N- Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:45.94,00:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I feel that.\N- What is it, the subway?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:47.81,00:10:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's no subway here.\N- F train, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:50.11,00:10:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the water main.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:51.61,00:10:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else down there.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:53.11,00:10:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Water main doesn't run through here.\N- Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:54.94,00:10:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something down there\Nand it's moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:01.83,00:11:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody move back.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:04.50,00:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Back it up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:07.29,00:11:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:09.46,00:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, folks. Back up.\NGet back.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:19.80,00:11:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out here. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:27.56,00:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go! Move!\N- Everybody get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:29.48,00:11:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone back up!\NEveryone clear the intersection!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:32.48,00:11:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! Back up!\NBack up! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:53.50,00:11:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forget it! Get back!\N- Get the hell out of the street!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:08.98,00:12:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Move away!
Dialogue: 0,00:12:11.86,00:12:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta\Nclear this area now!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:05.07,00:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my car!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:09.08,00:13:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:10.66,00:13:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:36.94,00:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:39.78,00:13:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, people! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:40.19,00:13:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, back up!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:43.07,00:13:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Move back!
Dialogue: 0,00:15:07.99,00:15:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,00:15:11.99,00:15:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:15.37,00:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray, no. Stay, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:26.55,00:15:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:28.68,00:15:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just stay back here. Stay back!\N- Wow.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:48.20,00:15:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:23.42,00:17:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a fire.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:26.00,00:17:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- See? That looks like smoke to me.\N- What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:29.30,00:17:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you now.\NWe've only got about another minute.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:39.68,00:17:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:41.64,00:17:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:49.23,00:17:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just keep it down.\N- Ray, I'm standing right beside you.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:51.57,00:17:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please answer me?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:55.36,00:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get in the front seat, Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:02.62,00:18:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whose car is this?\N- Just get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:04.25,00:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose car is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:08.75,00:18:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, Ray.\NYou were absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:08.80,00:18:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey, Ray.\NYou were absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:11.42,00:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exact...\NI had to change the solen...
Dialogue: 0,00:18:15.09,00:18:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:17.18,00:18:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ray? Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:18.47,00:18:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get out of the truck. I'm not\Nkidding now. Get out of the car, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:19.47,00:18:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get in.\NI'm not getting in.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:21.52,00:18:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Manny, get in with us.\N- I'm not gonna get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:24.27,00:18:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, I'm not fooling around...\N- Close the door, Robbie. Close it.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:28.40,00:18:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray, bring the car back, Ray.\NIt's not my car.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:33.61,00:18:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!\NGet down, get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,00:18:35.36,00:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just get down. Get down! Get down!\N- Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,00:19:11.02,00:19:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna know everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:14.03,00:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,00:19:15.49,00:19:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This machine,\Nit crawled out of the ground,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:17.45,00:19:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,started torching everything.\NIt was killing everybody.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:31.42,00:19:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That machine,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:33.17,00:19:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it was already buried.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:36.97,00:19:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it...
Dialogue: 0,00:19:39.18,00:19:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...it came down in the lightning storm.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:43.14,00:19:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- They came down in a lightning storm.\N- What do you mean, came down?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:47.23,00:19:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- You said it was buried.\N- No, the machine I'm talking about
Dialogue: 0,00:19:49.90,00:19:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,was buried, but what\Ncame down in the lightning storm,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:53.73,00:19:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,what operates it,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:55.61,00:19:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the... You know.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:58.45,00:19:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- The what?\N- That's...
Dialogue: 0,00:19:59.78,00:20:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't there any helicopters\Nor airplanes?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:17.17,00:20:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie, get the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:21.01,00:20:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:22.85,00:20:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom!\N- Mom!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:24.51,00:20:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:27.02,00:20:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom? Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:32.19,00:20:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom? Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:37.99,00:20:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom?\N- Mom?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:39.78,00:20:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tim?!\N- Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:44.08,00:20:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tim?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:46.70,00:20:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:49.08,00:20:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:51.54,00:20:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:53.63,00:20:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead. All right?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:55.71,00:20:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just not here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:57.21,00:20:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- They were never here.\N- How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:59.97,00:21:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they're\Non their way to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:02.30,00:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And so they just...
Dialogue: 0,00:21:04.39,00:21:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...kept on going up to Boston.\NProbably at your grandma's house.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:05.55,00:21:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...kept on going up to Boston.\NProbably at your grandma's house.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:07.81,00:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If everything's fine, why do we\Nhave to sleep in the basement?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:10.48,00:21:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- We've got perfectly good beds.\N- Hey, it's like a slumber party.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:13.81,00:21:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you afraid\Nis gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:15.48,00:21:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice basement.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:17.07,00:21:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna sleep in my bed.\NGot back problems.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:36.98,00:22:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the lightning back?
Dialogue: 0,00:22:55.25,00:22:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:07.50,00:25:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Down here.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:13.51,00:25:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you on this plane?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:16.68,00:25:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...?\NAre you a passenger?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:25.86,00:25:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing?\NWanna help me open this?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:31.28,00:25:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a passenger?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:33.24,00:25:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's deaf.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:35.07,00:25:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The shell went off right beside him.\NCamera on his shoulder saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:39.75,00:25:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:42.08,00:25:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Out there in the Pine Barrens.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:44.83,00:25:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We were attached to\Na National Guard unit.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:46.92,00:25:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The 83rd Mechanized.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:48.50,00:25:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They moved on one of those things\Naround midnight.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:50.92,00:25:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They got some kind of shield\Naround them.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:52.68,00:25:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see it, but everything we fire\Nat them detonates too early,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:55.59,00:25:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,before we can get close enough\Nto cause any damage.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:59.52,00:26:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We were feeding New York,\Nbut New York went dark.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:01.81,00:26:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So we patched over to D.C.,\Nthey went down.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:04.35,00:26:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,L.A., Chicago, uplinked to London.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:05.73,00:26:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,L.A., Chicago, uplinked to London.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:07.27,00:26:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even called the affiliates to try\Nto get them to catch the feed,
Dialogue: 0,00:26:10.61,00:26:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but nobody answers.\NIt's the same everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:13.45,00:26:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Tripods start to move,\Nno more news comes out of that area.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:30.21,00:26:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:32.30,00:26:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:38.14,00:26:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in, get in, get in, get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:40.56,00:26:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing good. You're doing good.\NKeep your eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:43.60,00:26:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going right to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:44.98,00:26:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're gonna see your mom.\N- I'm not gonna look, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:47.35,00:26:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a girl. That's my girl.\NNow listen.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:49.57,00:26:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want you to close your eyes, okay?\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:51.48,00:26:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got them closed? There you go.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:54.03,00:26:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Keep them closed for me.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:01.58,00:27:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie, get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:05.75,00:27:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:28.56,00:27:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why aren't we on the turnpike?\N- I don't want everybody
Dialogue: 0,00:27:30.90,00:27:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to see that we've got a working car.\NWe'll stay along the Hudson
Dialogue: 0,00:27:33.57,00:27:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,till we find an open bridge or ferry,\Nthen we're gonna cross the Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:37.07,00:27:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take the back roads across\NConnecticut, all the way to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:01.68,00:28:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll close my eyes.\NWhy don't you drive for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:05.47,00:28:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a license.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:08.64,00:28:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when has that stopped you?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:41.64,00:28:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:44.43,00:28:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:28:46.68,00:28:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:28:50.44,00:28:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you could...?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:52.90,00:28:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you could...?\NDo you think you could...?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:56.44,00:28:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:58.03,00:28:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take your foot off. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:00.28,00:29:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it, but keep your foot on.\NOkay, I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:03.03,00:29:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where is everybody going?\N- I don't know, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:06.41,00:29:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But we do, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:08.58,00:29:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:24.68,00:29:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Be careful.\N- How'd you fix this?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:26.72,00:29:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- How'd you fix the car?\N- Please! Why won't you help us?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:32.19,00:29:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:34.19,00:29:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get away from the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:35.86,00:29:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:38.11,00:29:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop the car!\N- Get off the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:29:41.74,00:29:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You could carry 20 people in there!
Dialogue: 0,00:29:44.03,00:29:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop the car!\N- Get off the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:29:46.24,00:29:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:01.80,00:30:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:30:16.48,00:30:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:18.48,00:30:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Just wait! Okay! Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:21.19,00:30:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just stop!\N- Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:23.28,00:30:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:25.45,00:30:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:28.53,00:30:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:37.71,00:30:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:39.75,00:30:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ray!\N- Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:47.22,00:30:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Rachel! Get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:30:50.10,00:30:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel, get...\NGet out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:52.31,00:30:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out!\N- Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:02.11,00:31:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take it easy!\N- Get off the car!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:04.40,00:31:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:05.99,00:31:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off the car! Move!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:07.66,00:31:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:09.58,00:31:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where's my son?\N- You don't need that, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:11.58,00:31:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where's my son? Robbie!\N- Cool down, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:14.29,00:31:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put the gun down, man.\N- Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:23.01,00:31:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now, listen.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:24.88,00:31:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put down the gun. I'm taking the car.\N- My daughter's in the car.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:28.05,00:31:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm taking the car, man.\N- Please. All I want...
Dialogue: 0,00:31:30.22,00:31:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- Put down the goddamn gun!\N- All I want is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:33.06,00:31:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm taking the car, man.\N- Please, I just want my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:35.60,00:31:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me just take my daughter.\NCan I...?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:37.77,00:31:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- All I want is my daughter.\N- Yeah. Okay, go ahead, man.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:41.52,00:31:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:52.95,00:31:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,00:32:56.85,00:32:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen this girl?\NThis is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:58.98,00:33:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs his medicine.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:12.45,00:33:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Looks like the power's still on here.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:15.41,00:33:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, power's still on.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:17.66,00:33:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Because nothing bad's come up\Nfrom the ground.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:20.100,00:33:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on. Hold on, move back!\N- Watch out there, lady!
Dialogue: 0,00:33:24.50,00:33:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, move back!
Dialogue: 0,00:34:02.91,00:34:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you are O-positive\Nand RH-negative,
Dialogue: 0,00:34:06.29,00:34:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you very much, but we already\Nhave more blood than we can use.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:10.63,00:34:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, if you are O-positive,\NRH-negative, identify yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:17.55,00:34:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are not, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:19.81,00:34:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have more blood\Nthan we can use for the transfusions.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:23.10,00:34:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, folks.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:25.10,00:34:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This way. This way.\NKeep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:28.23,00:34:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving. This way.\NLet's go, folks. Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:32.44,00:34:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please move forward calmly.\NThe boat can make more than one trip.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:36.62,00:34:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please move forward calmly.\NTake your time. Don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:41.12,00:34:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray! Ray! Ray!
Dialogue: 0,00:34:43.58,00:34:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sheryl?\N- Yeah. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:46.12,00:34:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh, is this your...?
Dialogue: 0,00:34:48.08,00:34:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are these your kids?\N- Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:49.46,00:34:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Sheryl.\NThis is my daughter, Nora.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:52.17,00:34:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nora. I've heard about you, Nora.\N- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:54.59,00:34:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is my son, Robbie.\N- Just like Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:12.65,00:35:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's good to see you as well.\N- Trees are funny.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:15.95,00:35:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna move a few cars out\Nof the way to make some more space.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:21.16,00:35:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to give us\Na few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:23.45,00:35:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry,\Nthere'll be plenty of room for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:26.79,00:35:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We got sick people here.\NLet us on.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:05.04,00:36:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast off. Get that ramp up.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:06.83,00:36:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast off now. Get that ramp up.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:10.88,00:36:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast off.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:12.25,00:36:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No more people. No more people.\NWe're taking the ramp up.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:40.78,00:36:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close. Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:44.33,00:36:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody stop. Everybody stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:47.16,00:36:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait, wait, wait. Just...\N- Back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:51.58,00:36:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everybody, wait.\N- Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:52.67,00:36:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- You just stay with me.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:54.46,00:36:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:55.67,00:36:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:57.38,00:36:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:58.63,00:37:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, Ferrier.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:00.26,00:37:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Jesus.\N- You okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:02.26,00:37:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:03.47,00:37:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, Jesus. Oh, my God.\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:06.01,00:37:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:14.94,00:37:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:17.44,00:37:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:19.28,00:37:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,00:37:21.15,00:37:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheryl?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:23.37,00:37:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with them. Go.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:25.62,00:37:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ray.\N- Sheryl?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:26.83,00:37:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everybody...\N- Sheryl?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:28.66,00:37:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's room on the boat.\N- Let us through, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:31.67,00:37:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's still room on the boat.\N- She's a child.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:39.26,00:37:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie.\N- Just stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:41.13,00:37:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:03.57,00:38:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:24.88,00:38:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:39:10.22,00:39:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Swim. Swim this way!
Dialogue: 0,00:40:05.78,00:40:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie, help me with her.\N- Here, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:11.62,00:40:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop. Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:14.74,00:40:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:33.22,00:40:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:40.83,00:41:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:42.67,00:41:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:44.67,00:41:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for God's sake, stay right here.\NI'm coming right back.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:47.67,00:41:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Robbie!\N- Stop those people.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:49.84,00:41:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Turn around. Turn around.\N- Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:52.55,00:41:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:54.09,00:41:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:55.51,00:41:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,00:41:56.89,00:41:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:02.23,00:42:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull back.\NFive hundred meters to my 10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:07.69,00:42:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jekyll, no effect on target.\NNo effect.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:10.07,00:42:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. No effect.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:11.44,00:42:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission, lieutenant,\Nis to delay their advance
Dialogue: 0,00:42:14.41,00:42:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,till those refugees get to safety.\NNow, keep firing.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:19.33,00:42:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta listen. Turn around!\NI want you to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:25.25,00:42:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:26.42,00:42:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back down the hill!
Dialogue: 0,00:42:28.21,00:42:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, just turn around!
Dialogue: 0,00:42:44.56,00:42:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here\Nall by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:45.10,00:42:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here\Nall by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:46.44,00:42:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, you gotta come with us,\Nplease.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:48.31,00:42:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- My dad's right there.\N- Please, come.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:49.82,00:42:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, my dad's right there.\N- Listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,00:42:51.78,00:42:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be here. I want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:54.70,00:42:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Wait... Just stay for Rachel.\NStay for your sister.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:57.32,00:43:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go.\NYou need to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:04.33,00:43:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:05.54,00:43:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're coming with us.\N- Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:06.96,00:43:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're going now.\N- I can't.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:09.04,00:43:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:43:14.38,00:43:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:16.84,00:43:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:43:23.81,00:43:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,00:43:28.90,00:43:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide on. Guide on.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:30.15,00:43:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Six. Attack. Attack. Attack.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:34.65,00:43:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:36.45,00:43:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's my dad.\N- I'm her father. I'm her father.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:39.45,00:43:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're so sorry.\N- We thought she was alone.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:41.62,00:43:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- She was standing by the tree...\N- She's fine. Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,00:43:48.33,00:43:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:59.80,00:44:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:20.45,00:44:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:22.03,00:44:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:27.04,00:44:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:48.43,00:44:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,00:44:50.23,00:44:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:53.77,00:44:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:09.58,00:45:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:12.92,00:45:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:16.88,00:45:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to close\Nyour eyes now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:19.72,00:45:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You need some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:23.80,00:45:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:25.47,00:45:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna meet us.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:28.31,00:45:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Robbie's gonna meet us, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:30.73,00:45:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In Boston, at your grandma's.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:33.27,00:45:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think\NMom's doing right this minute?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:36.61,00:45:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:39.19,00:45:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Boston. She's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:41.70,00:45:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know she's not sleeping,\Nbecause she is so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:45.41,00:45:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's in Grandma's kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,00:45:47.12,00:45:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and she's...
Dialogue: 0,00:45:50.41,00:45:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's making that awful tea\Nshe makes.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:53.46,00:45:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're all just...
Dialogue: 0,00:45:56.04,00:45:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all just counting the minutes\Nuntil they see you again.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:01.59,00:46:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:03.18,00:46:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:05.18,00:46:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I won.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:06.51,00:46:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You won?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:07.97,00:46:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The walk, trot and canter.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:10.39,00:46:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Third place.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:19.90,00:46:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach schnapps.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:21.74,00:46:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:23.49,00:46:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Found a whole case of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:32.50,00:46:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:39.34,00:46:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about your son.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:41.67,00:46:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We got separated. He's...
Dialogue: 0,00:46:43.42,00:46:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna meet us in Boston.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:53.14,00:46:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you...?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:56.60,00:46:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you lose anybody?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:00.86,00:47:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:05.49,00:47:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Harlan Ogilvy.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:08.99,00:47:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray Ferrier.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:10.58,00:47:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I got water.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:13.50,00:47:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Food enough for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:16.54,00:47:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to stay. Both of youse.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:19.46,00:47:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:22.21,00:47:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:26.01,00:47:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Those machines, those...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:28.80,00:47:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...Tripods they got?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:33.18,00:47:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They buried them.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:36.02,00:47:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right under our feet.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:39.27,00:47:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Since before there...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:41.65,00:47:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There were even people here.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:44.65,00:47:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been planning this\Nfor a million years.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:49.41,00:47:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're beat to shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:51.16,00:47:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:52.49,00:47:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- My daughter...\N- Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:57.87,00:48:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They defeated the greatest power\Nin the world in a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:01.50,00:48:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Walked right over us.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:03.92,00:48:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And these are only the first.\NThey'll keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:08.18,00:48:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a war
Dialogue: 0,00:48:09.72,00:48:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,any more than there's\Na war between men and maggots.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:13.10,00:48:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an extermination.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:25.90,00:48:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:29.41,00:48:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:33.74,00:48:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I been around death plenty.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:37.25,00:48:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I drive an ambulance in the city...
Dialogue: 0,00:48:39.12,00:48:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Drove an ambulance in the city.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:41.75,00:48:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all over now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:47.17,00:48:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the people\Nthat make it, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:50.47,00:48:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones that don't flatline\Nbefore the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:56.31,00:48:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ones\Nthat keep their eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:59.98,00:49:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That keep looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:01.52,00:49:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep thinking.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:03.31,00:49:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones that survive.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:07.32,00:49:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose our heads, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:11.57,00:49:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:13.74,00:49:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:17.33,00:49:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm dead set on living.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:25.29,00:49:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead set on living...
Dialogue: 0,00:49:30.22,00:49:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking us in.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:39.52,00:49:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna be exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:57.58,00:49:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:59.50,00:50:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:02.12,00:50:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fight them, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:03.83,00:50:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They gotta have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:05.21,00:50:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:14.68,00:50:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow they killed\Na few of these things in Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:17.22,00:50:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:18.43,00:50:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You telling me the Japanese\Ncan figure it out, but we can't?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:21.02,00:50:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:22.64,00:50:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do it. We can get them.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:24.60,00:50:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:27.02,00:50:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:48.13,00:50:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:50.09,00:50:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring us here?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:51.71,00:50:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight them together, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:54.63,00:50:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll be the ones coming up\Nfrom underground.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:59.60,00:51:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time is right...
Dialogue: 0,00:51:01.64,00:51:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...take them by surprise,\Nthe way they took us.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:04.98,00:51:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:08.31,00:51:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right under their feet, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:09.86,00:51:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here. Under their feet.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:01.33,00:52:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You miss your mommy?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:03.99,00:52:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:06.83,00:52:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly your age.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:09.46,00:52:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if anything happens\Nto your daddy,
Dialogue: 0,00:52:12.17,00:52:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:13.96,00:52:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:23.47,00:52:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have\Nanything to say to her.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:25.68,00:52:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:27.94,00:52:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna talk to somebody,
Dialogue: 0,00:52:29.77,00:52:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,if you wanna ask a question,\Nyou ask me.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:31.52,00:52:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is your plan, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:34.19,00:52:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm gonna do.\NHow about you?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:37.32,00:52:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna sit here?\NWait for them to come get you?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:40.61,00:52:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your plan?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:43.20,00:52:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you wanna get caught.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:46.70,00:52:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Couple days hiding in a basement\Ntoo much for you, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:50.42,00:52:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll probably turn yourself right in.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:56.21,00:52:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:58.88,00:53:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:00.38,00:53:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:01.89,00:53:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll get lucky,\Nand they'll train you as their pet.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:04.85,00:53:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, feed you,\Ntrain you how to do tricks.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:05.34,00:55:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>No.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:55:09.18,00:55:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>No. No.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:55:12.18,00:55:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:11.40,01:00:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray. Ray.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:14.23,01:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray. Ray. Ray!
Dialogue: 0,01:00:17.15,01:00:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,01:00:18.86,01:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down. Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,01:01:03.16,01:01:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood. Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:08.83,01:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:11.71,01:01:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my...
Dialogue: 0,01:01:14.13,01:01:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not...
Dialogue: 0,01:01:16.71,01:01:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...my...
Dialogue: 0,01:01:20.30,01:01:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:22.89,01:01:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:24.47,01:01:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:26.22,01:01:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:28.06,01:01:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:29.64,01:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not my blood.\N- Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:31.40,01:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it.\N- Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:33.11,01:01:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it.\N- Not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:34.52,01:01:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:36.23,01:01:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want them to hear you?\N- They drink us.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:38.28,01:01:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, they'll hear you.\N- They drink us.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:40.36,01:01:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they spray us, like fertilizer.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:43.41,01:01:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:44.91,01:01:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Drink us, and...\N- They're gonna come back down here.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:47.83,01:01:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they spit us out all over\Nthe goddamn red weeds.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:50.100,01:01:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand\Nwhat I'm gonna have to do?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:53.00,01:01:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let my daughter die\Nbecause of you.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:54.92,01:01:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This tunnel will get us to the city.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:57.05,01:01:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have tunnels there.\NReady-made.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:58.92,01:02:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it.\N- Subway. See what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:00.67,01:02:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hide an army down there.\N- Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:02.18,01:02:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go underground.\NSneak attacks at night.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:03.93,01:02:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You stop it!
Dialogue: 0,01:02:07.31,01:02:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the resistance, Ray.\NThey can't occupy this country.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:10.60,01:02:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Occupations always fail. History's\Ntaught us that a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:14.19,01:02:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our land.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:16.69,01:02:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We eat it, we breathe it,\Nonly we can live on it.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:20.07,01:02:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't survive here, Ray.\NThey weren't built for it.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:24.07,01:02:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you, brother,\Nnot me!
Dialogue: 0,01:02:26.41,01:02:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing, Dad?\N- Not my blood!
Dialogue: 0,01:02:29.04,01:02:31.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you hear,\Ndon't take this off.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:32.37,01:02:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dad?\N- Rach?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:34.04,01:02:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dad?\N- What was that song?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:36.59,01:02:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- That lullaby that I didn't know?\N- Not my blood!
Dialogue: 0,01:02:40.30,01:02:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Hushabye Mountain"?\N- Yeah, sing it.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:42.34,01:02:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- They can take you!\N- Please, Rach, sing it.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:45.30,01:02:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- They can take you!\N- A gentle breeze</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:02:48.68,01:02:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your daughter!\N- Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:50.43,01:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- Not me!\N- On Hushabye Mountain</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:02:53.10,01:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're gonna kill you!\N- That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:54.90,01:02:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Softly blows over Lullaby Bay</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:02:59.98,01:03:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>- Forget it! Tunnel!\N- It fills the sails</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:03:05.24,01:03:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Of boats that are waiting</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:03:09.58,01:03:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Waiting to sail\NYour worries away</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:05:04.61,01:05:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:06.69,01:05:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:08.99,01:05:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:14.41,01:05:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:15.20,01:05:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel? Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:28.92,01:05:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel? Make some noise, baby.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:31.68,01:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:34.51,01:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:40.77,01:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel? Talk to me, baby. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:47.28,01:05:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:51.99,01:05:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:06:07.75,01:06:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:06:09.84,01:06:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,01:07:18.41,01:07:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,01:07:20.66,01:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:07:52.90,01:07:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,01:08:31.15,01:08:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,01:08:36.57,01:08:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,01:09:09.48,01:09:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:11.40,01:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:15.02,01:09:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:18.15,01:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,01:09:21.20,01:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:23.87,01:09:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:52.19,01:09:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:09:54.86,01:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me! Pull me!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:04.20,01:10:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull! Pull!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:06.87,01:10:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me! Come on, pull!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:12.79,01:10:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dad!\N- One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:15.42,01:10:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him! Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:25.97,01:10:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody down!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:20.19,01:11:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving, folks.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:25.66,01:11:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going, sir. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:28.24,01:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:32.62,01:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold Grandma's hand.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:36.62,01:11:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, folks.\NKeep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:50.35,01:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that down.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:54.60,01:11:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way, ma'am.\NRight this way, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:05.53,01:12:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left, there, ma'am,\Njust to your left. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:10.62,01:12:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,01:12:16.79,01:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dying.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:20.79,01:12:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:32.97,01:12:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving, it's all right!
Dialogue: 0,01:12:34.56,01:12:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can pass on through.\NMove along!
Dialogue: 0,01:12:36.48,01:12:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened here?\N- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:37.98,01:12:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening to them.\NPlease, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:40.06,01:12:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go, move out.\N- Let's go, people.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:41.77,01:12:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Something's happening to them?\N- Go. Go, just keep moving, sir.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:45.07,01:12:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, sir. Let's go. Do not stop.\NKeep moving. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:47.82,01:12:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. What's happened here?\NDid you guys take it down?
Dialogue: 0,01:12:50.20,01:12:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir, it was behaving erratically,\Nwalking in circles,
Dialogue: 0,01:12:52.58,01:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,then it went down on its own\Nabout an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:54.58,01:12:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please, let's go! Let's go!\NKeep moving! Come on! Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,01:12:57.58,01:12:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not stop! Let's go! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,01:13:01.13,01:13:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it dead all by itself?
Dialogue: 0,01:13:03.21,01:13:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Rachel, I'm not sure.\N- Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:05.92,01:13:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through. Make a hole.\NComing through.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:28.95,01:13:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.\NCalm down and get in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:31.36,01:13:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down and get in the tunnel.\NCalm down and get in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:48.97,01:13:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safer in here.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:50.34,01:13:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,01:13:52.39,01:13:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out the Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:02.48,01:14:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear! Get from behind! Clear!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:14.03,01:14:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me know when you're tracking!\N- Tracking!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:16.58,01:14:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- You got a lock?\N- I got a lock!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:18.33,01:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:26.84,01:14:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got a lock!\N- Fire the Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:32.38,01:14:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:48.23,01:14:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:51.19,01:14:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:53.24,01:14:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's okay. You're gonna be okay.\N- Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:57.28,01:14:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those civilians out of there.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:59.58,01:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Back. Stay back!\NCome on, folks, back up!
Dialogue: 0,01:15:08.46,01:15:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, get on the line.\NGet up there now.
